REMARK   3 FITTING PROCEDURE : STARTING MODEL WAS GENERATED BY STRIPPING PDB    
REMARK   3  ENTRY 1YAR OF ALL LIGANDS AND ALTERNATE CONFORMATIONS, THEN         
REMARK   3  REFINING INTO THE EM DENSITY USING IMPOSED SYMMETRY WHILE           
REMARK   3  ADJUSTING WEIGHTING/SCORING ACCORDING TO ESTIMATED MAP              
REMARK   3  RESOLUTION. THE TOP 10 GENERATED MODELS (RANKED BASED ON QUALITY    
REMARK   3  METRICS) WERE REAL-SPACE REFINED USING PHENIX SOFTWARE.             
